rem known-good.bbj: harness control. A window with a static text and a button that opens a message box. The harness must classify it as pass.
wnd! = BBjAPI().openSysGui("X0").addWindow("Courses fixture good", $01101083$)
st! = wnd!.addStaticText("Known good")
btn! = wnd!.addButton("Say Hello")
wnd!.setCallback(BBjAPI.ON_CLOSE, "byebye")
btn!.setCallback(BBjAPI.ON_BUTTON_PUSH, "sayhello")
process_events

byebye:
release

sayhello:
a = msgbox("Hello fixture", 64, "Fixture")
return
